    {
      "id": "oWPxgbjYpE77joRedS7km",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 352.7317389352254,
      "y": -930.6647741590405,
      "width": 1596.4000244140625,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "8x_DAq-ktHCLztPLldBrr",
      "index": "bo3V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 82305958,
      "version": 485,
      "versionNonce": 178756357,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779230064533,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "¿Qué son exactamente los wi's que se toman en este caso con i = 1,...,7 en la matriz y cómo\nse da cuenta que por ejemplo w1,w2,...,w7 en C si y solo si: w1 + w5 + w7 = 0?",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "¿Qué son exactamente los wi's que se toman en este caso con i = 1,...,7 en la matriz y cómo\nse da cuenta que por ejemplo w1,w2,...,w7 en C si y solo si: w1 + w5 + w7 = 0?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2Cf3-XymLew1BGXKOxaH8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 347.84285004633784,
      "y": -302.2996947939605,
      "width": 85.43333435058594,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "8x_DAq-ktHCLztPLldBrr",
      "index": "bo4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 582139115,
      "version": 43,
      "versionNonce": 158811083,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779230064533,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RTA:",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "RTA:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wJTwvpOR5OaGxO6-RvXd6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 354.41427861776634,
      "y": -256.5854090796747,
      "width": 1482.5833740234375,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "8x_DAq-ktHCLztPLldBrr",
      "index": "bo5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 680212267,
      "version": 252,
      "versionNonce": 2063086693,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779230082823,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Son simplemente los bits que conforman a los vectores filas, vease la primer fila de H\n1 0 0 0 1 0 1 => 1 * w1 + 0 * w2 + 0 * w3 + 0 * w4 + 1 * w5 + 0 * w6 + 1 * w7\n                 => w1 + w5 + w7 = 0 (ya que C = Nu(H))",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Son simplemente los bits que conforman a los vectores filas, vease la primer fila de H\n1 0 0 0 1 0 1 => 1 * w1 + 0 * w2 + 0 * w3 + 0 * w4 + 1 * w5 + 0 * w6 + 1 * w7\n                 => w1 + w5 + w7 = 0 (ya que C = Nu(H))",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
